sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant V as Vision Agent
    participant PF as Preflight
    participant S as Solver Agent
    participant RV as Fast SymPy Verifier
    participant G as Grader Agent
    participant R as Reviewer Agent
    participant T as Report/SQLite

    U->>UI: choose 1-8 photos of one solution
    UI->>API: POST /api/reviews/photos, images[]
    alt one photo
        API->>V: original image bytes
    else several photos
        API->>API: stitch pages in upload order
        API->>V: one ordered multi-page image
    end
    V-->>API: draft student transcript + uncertainty metadata
    API-->>UI: OCR draft + detected equation/interval + progress time
    UI-->>U: show all source photos and editable fields

    loop until input is unambiguous
        U->>UI: edit equation / interval / student transcript
        UI->>API: POST /api/reviews/preflight
        API->>PF: deterministic EGE-13 validation
        PF-->>API: ok or concrete issues
        API-->>UI: validation result
    end

    U->>UI: confirm and start grading
    UI->>API: POST /api/reviews/confirm-transcript
    API->>S: confirmed equation + interval only
    S-->>API: independent reference solution
    API->>RV: confirmed task + solver spec
    RV-->>API: verified families and interval roots
    API->>G: confirmed student transcript + verified reference + criteria
    G-->>API: deterministic draft score + compact LLM audit
    API->>R: immutable draft score + audit facts
    R-->>API: consistency advisory
    API->>T: build report, reference circle, save history
    T-->>API: persisted review/report
    API-->>UI: final score + expert comments + correct answer + timings
    UI-->>U: final report
